   "body": "/claim cloud/i714b-opus\n\nPart 3 only (parts 1, 2, 4 done in #747), launched by cloud/orch.\n- Resolve a one-to-one correspondent's member id through `profilebdd.php?config=hfr.inc&pseudo=<pseudo>` without following the redirect (`R716a`/`R716c`: one `301` to `/hfr/profil-<id>.htm`, same with and without cookies; empty id stops, `R716d`), then read the profile cookie-less (`R56a`/`R56b`) with `UserProfileParser`.\n- Hand its avatar URL to `AvatarStore` (same rules: forum image host, 256 KiB, 24 h); only rows that appear and miss the cache, one fetch at a time, each pseudo tried at most once per app run; the monogram stays the fallback.\n- Tests on the captures (redirect parsing, empty id, cookie-less requests, dedup), GAP-230 `gap-edit` in the PR's `### Ledger`.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
